  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Discover your ideal beach getaway at Wine and Waves, nestled in the charming town of Inlet Beach, Florida. With spring and summer bookings opening early this year, we’re delighted to offer special discounts, but hurry—availability is filling up fast!<br><br>Wine and Waves is your perfect home base, surrounded by thrilling attractions and activities. Just 0.6 miles from one of Florida’s most breathtaking beaches, our spacious retreat accommodates up to 13 guests, making it an ideal choice for family reunions or vacations with friends. Plus, we’re located next to the lively 30Avenue Pavilions, with the enchanting Town of Rosemary Beach and the scenic 30A route just a quick bike ride away.<br><br>To ensure you have a fantastic stay, we’re here to help you plan every detail of your vacation. Don’t hesitate to reach out with any questions about the area. After booking, you’ll also receive a curated list of our favorite local recommendations to enhance your experience.<br><br> Inside Wine and Waves:<br>- Four Bedrooms: Two luxurious King bedrooms, including one on the ground floor for easy access.<br>- 3.5 Bathrooms: Plenty of space for everyone.<br>- Parking: Three dedicated parking spaces available.<br>- Recreation: Enjoy five bikes for exploring the area, an INFINITY GAME TABLE featuring over 50 games, a gas fire pit table, and a foosball table!<br>- Family-Friendly Amenities: We offer a Pack 'n Play and high chair for families with young children, plus lots of beach gear and towels.<br>- Community Pool Access: Take a refreshing dip just steps away.<br>- Entertainment: Each bedroom and living area is equipped with a mounted Smart TV, featuring FUBO TV for hundreds of live sports channels and on-demand movies.<br>- Comfort and Convenience: Relax with high-quality linens, premium comfort mattresses, fast complimentary WIFI, a well-stocked kitchen, BBQ grill, and a designated workspace with extra outlets.<br>- Extras: Don’t forget the outdoor shower for rinsing off after a day at the beach, as well as a washer and dryer, and an ironing board/iron for your convenience.<br><br>This is more than just a place to stay; it’s a home where memories are made. Let Emerald Waves be your gateway to unforgettable beach adventures! <br><br>HOUSE RULES:<br>-Minimum of 25 years to book<br>- Must sign rental agreement upon booking and upload a copy of your driver license <br>- Per our rental insurance, the person who signs our rental agreement must be 25 years or older and stay at the property.<br>- No parties allowed at this property. Vacation homes in the area may lose their rental license if parties occur.<br>- We ask for a separate rental agreement to be signed after booking. The signor and responsible guest must be a minimum of 25.<br>- We place a $500 security damage deposit \"hold\" on your credit card 2 days before your stay. The hold will be released 7 days after your departure if no damages have occurred.<br>- If you open it, close it. If you borrow it, return it. If you turn it on, turn it off. If you break it, fix it. If you use it, take care of it. If you make a mess, clean it up. If you move it, put it back.<br>- No smoking anywhere on the property<br>- No pets<br>- No shoes in the house<br>- No unattached trailers allowed on the property.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Wine & Waves Perfect 30A Beach Escape Awaits You"
        }
      ],
